---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro'
import { SOCIALS } from '../consts'
---
<Base title="About">
  <h1 class="page-title">About</h1>
  <div class="prose">
    <p>
      I'm <strong>Nitesh Balla</strong>, a <strong>Forward Deployed Engineer at
      <a href="https://manif.ai">Manif</a></strong>, where we build the financial
      infrastructure and control plane for agentic commerce. The work is to sit
      close to customers, build against the specifics of their problem, and ship
      systems that survive contact with production.
    </p>

    <h2>How I work</h2>
    <p>
      I'm drawn to the gap between what a product can do and what a customer
      actually needs. That usually means writing code in the field, choosing which
      corners to cut on purpose, and owning the result end to end. Most of what
      I've shipped lives in payments, where the trade-offs are unforgiving and the
      failure modes are public.
    </p>

    <h2>What I work with</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Backend</strong> — Rust, C++, Java, Python, Node.js</li>
      <li><strong>Frontend</strong> — TypeScript, React, Next.js</li>
      <li><strong>Cloud &amp; infra</strong> — AWS, Azure, Terraform, Docker, Kubernetes, CI/CD</li>
      <li><strong>Data</strong> — PostgreSQL, MongoDB, Redis</li>
      <li><strong>Domain</strong> — payment systems, PCI and ISO compliance</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Before this</h2>
    <p>
      I led engineering at <strong>GreenBanana Group</strong> (Germany), working
      remotely on financial products. Before that I was a product engineer at
      <strong>Juspay</strong>, where I built payment systems and contributed to
      <a href="https://github.com/juspay/hyperswitch">Hyperswitch</a>, the
      open-source payment orchestrator.
    </p>

    <h2>Connect</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><a href={SOCIALS.github}>GitHub</a></li>
      <li><a href={SOCIALS.linkedin}>LinkedIn</a></li>
      <li><a href={`mailto:${SOCIALS.email}`}>{SOCIALS.email}</a></li>
    </ul>
    <p>Feel free to reach out to connect or discuss anything I write about.</p>
  </div>
</Base>
